es": {"Node name for S&R": "easy imageSize"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [733, 765], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "size": {"0": 312.53631591796875, "1": 328.41204833984375}, "pos": [-1431.3603268322236, 78.78042706946792], "widgets_values": ["", "This image shows a woman's hand holding a cosmetic product against a backdrop of lush green grass dotted with white daisies. The focus is on the bottle, which is an elegant container made of clear plastic with a white pump dispenser on top. The bottle contains a soft green liquid, implying a skincare or beauty product. The brand name printed on the bottle appears to be \"Leoffee,\" along with text describing the product as \"Facial Proshape 1000 & Estrinas,\" written in a light, minimalist font. The hand gripping the bottle has neatly manicured nails painted in a clean, pale pink color, adding a sense of sophistication. Bright sunlight enhances the fresh and natural aesthetic of the scene, with the daisies and grass in the background softly blurred to emphasize the product in the foreground. The image suggests themes of purity, wellness, and nature-inspired beauty."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 764, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 418, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 24}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#749975", "widgets_values": ["", "这张图显示了一个女人的手拿着美容产品的背景，这些郁郁葱葱的绿草上点缀着白色的雏菊。重点放在瓶子上，这是一个由透明塑料制成的优雅容器，顶部是白色泵送器。瓶子中含有柔软的绿色液体，意味着护肤产品或美容产品。瓶子上打印的品牌名称似乎是“ Leoffee”，以及将产品描述为“面部Proshape 1000＆Estrinas”的文字，用轻巧的简约字体写成。手握住瓶子的手的修剪整齐的指甲涂有干净的淡粉红色，增添了精致感。明亮的阳光增强了场景的新鲜和自然美感，背景中的雏菊和草柔和地模糊了前景中的产品。该图像提出了纯洁，健康和自然风格的美的主题。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 766, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "m